+Windows (Windows PowerShell 5.1+ or PowerShell 7):
+
+```powershell
+.\setup.ps1 -Run
+# Or generate, configure, build, test and launch a new project:
+.\setup.ps1 -Init MyProject -Output ..\MyProject -Run
